onomics\nDate of Joining:\n17/02/2024\nFaculty\nBiki Boro\nAssistant Professor\nQualification:\nM.A., UGC-NET\nArea of Interest:\nDevelopment Economics, Indian Economy\nDate of Joining:\n17/02/2024\nGovt. Model College, Balipara\nAffiliated to Gauhati University. A Government degree college serving Balipara and the Sonitpur district of Assam.\nBamgaon, Balipara, Sonitpur, Assam - 784101\n+91 7002355539\nbaliparamodelcollege@gmail.com\nQuick Links\nAbout the College\nAdmission\nNotice Board\nTeaching Staff\nGallery\nContact Us\nUseful Links\nSamarth Admission\nGauhati University\nDHE, Assam\nUGC\nMinistry of Education\nNational Scholarship Portal\nLocation\n© 2026\nGovt. Model College, Balipara\n. All Rights Reserved.\nVisitors\nMaintained by Variable Solutions", "links": [{"label": "Skip to content", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/department/economics#main"}, {"label": "7002355539", "url": "tel:+917002355539"}, {"label": "baliparamodelcollege@gmail.com", "url": "mailto:baliparamodelcollege@gmail.com"}, {"label": "Admin Login", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/login"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/"}, {"label": "Admission", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/admission_link"}, {"label": "GMC Balipara", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/"}, {"label": "About", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/department/economics"}, {"label": "History", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/about"}, {"label": "Vision & Mission", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/aim_objectives"}, {"label": "Principal's Message", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/principal_message"}, {"label": "Governing Body", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/gb"}, {"label": "Rules & Regulations", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/rule_regulations"}, {"label": "Administration", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/administrative_staff"}, {"label": "Staff", "url": "https://gmcbalipara.ac.in/home/departmen